  "whatsapp_greeting": "Hi! I'm the NewTritious Life Intake Assistant \ud83c\udf3f I'm here to help you prepare for your first consultation with Yael by gathering a bit of background about your health journey. It'll only take a few minutes and will help us make the most of your time together. Ready to get started?",
